se owner","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w8UBZMC8SAX9ldIVaFkC1q0hNLo.jpg"},{"id":4922,"name":"Ralf Richter","role":"Chief Police Officer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bHAjEep912NzHpmA4tKhEj13BmP.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La banda dei coccodrilli","overview":"Kai, un ragazzino in carrozzella, sogna di divenire un membro della banda dei ragazzi di quartiere, i Coccodrilli. Per via del suo handicap non è mai stato accettato dal gruppo, neanche quando salva la vita a Hannes, un altro bambino, durante un rito di iniziazione. Una notte Kai vede con il suo telescopio una rapina a un negozio e la ricompensa per chi trova i ladri convincerà i Coccodrilli a chiedere l’aiuto del bambino per una pericolosa avventura."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Crocodiles","overview":"Ten-year-old Hannes, growing up with his young, poor and single mother wants to join the coolest gang in the area, the Vorstadtkrokodile. When the ‘entry test’ goes wrong, Hannes’s life is saved by Kai, who is desperate to join too but is wheelchair bound and unable to even run away when things get hot. Hannes would accept Kai but the other gang members don’t seem happy to accept a handicapped member..."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Der zehnjährige Hannes, der bei seiner jungen, alleinerziehenden Mutter aufwächst, will unbedingt von der coolsten Jugendbande im Ort, den Vorstadtkrokodilen, aufgenommen werden und gerät bei der notwendigen Mutprobe in Lebensgefahr. In letzter Minute wird er von Kai gerettet, der auch unbedingt zur Bande gehören möchte. Das Problem: Kai sitzt im Rollstuhl und ist für die Kinder nur der “Spasti”, der noch nicht mal wegrennen kann, wenn’s brenzlig wird. Als Kai einen nächtlichen Einbruch beobachtet, wird er plötzlich interessant für die Krokodile, denn er ist ihr einziger Zeuge. Er wiederum redet nur, wenn er mitkommen darf. Mit seiner Hilfe und mit kroko-typischem Ideenreichtum, Mut und Phantasie machen sich die Vorstadtkrokodile auf, den Fall zu lösen und es mit der scheinbar übermächtigen Einbrecherbande aufzunehmen."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4RfnbsfZWQYyX4eBXUde1dMURzE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3n0MwFSjTZNYnHgtSrDmvxBS2Zo.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":12137,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4RfnbsfZWQYyX4eBXUde1dMURzE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4RfnbsfZWQYyX4eBXUde1dMURzE.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4RfnbsfZWQYyX4eBXUde1dMURzE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4RfnbsfZWQYyX4eBXUde1dMURzE.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ab9m3BGAOHRdEd5DfY0NFNTxBq4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ab9m3BGAOHRdEd5DfY0NFNTxBq4.jpg","language":"de","width":600,"height":900},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ab9m3BGAOHRdEd5DfY0NFNTxBq4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ab9m3BGAOHRdEd5DfY0NFNTxBq4.jpg","language":"de","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p5aQwGK1NVdYnc4ujSPgjGxF7Go.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p5aQwGK1NVdYnc4ujSPgjGxF7Go.jpg","language":"de","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/efiSMz18ywvDvpAjyG1VU6pfzMP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/efiSMz18ywvDvpAjyG1VU6pfzMP.jpg","language":"de","width":1998,"height":3000}]},"xx":{"status":"m